    function automatic int queue_pop_coupler_RESERVOIR_WATERMARK_ENTRIES(int SPOOL_UP, int BURSTMARK);
        // following reservoir formula : (spool up cycles + 1 + BURSTMARK)
        return (SPOOL_UP + 1 + BURSTMARK);
    endfunction
"
- correct arguments passed in
- we simply follow the reservoir formula for optimal generation
- WATERMARK_ENTRIES = SPOOL_UP + 1 + BURSTMARK follows the reservoir's continuous-burst formula
- BURSTMARK is necessarily no larger than this calculated watermark
